  "summary": "CGI versions before 5.00 for Perl allow CPU exhaustion via a backtracking regex on the XForms multipart/related…",
  "details": "CGI versions before 5.00 for Perl allow CPU exhaustion via a backtracking regex on the XForms multipart/related Content-Type.\n\nWhen a POST Content-Type contains multipart/related, the boundary and start parameters are extracted with an unanchored pattern that puts .+ on either side of the boundary capture, which backtracks in cubic time on a header that does not match. No request body is needed.",
